1
00:00:09,056 --> 00:00:11,212
Please marry me

2
00:00:11,212 --> 00:00:13,113
Can you promise?

3
00:00:13,113 --> 00:00:15,306
That you'll always be truthful?

4
00:00:20,614 --> 00:00:24,435
If you're her aunt, how can you not say anything when your niece is staying over with a man?

5
00:00:24,436 --> 00:00:25,746
That's not right!

6
00:00:25,747 --> 00:00:26,957
Go, quickly and show me the way.

7
00:00:27,885 --> 00:00:30,383
If you know she's staying over with a guy, just tell her to quickly come home.

8
00:00:30,384 --> 00:00:31,720
Why do you feel the need to go over there?

9
00:00:31,721 --> 00:00:33,779
Hah, just know that you became a doctor's wife thanks to me.

10
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:35,071
Mom's coming over.

11
00:00:35,683 --> 00:00:36,713
What?!

12
00:00:37,294 --> 00:00:38,949
My mom don't like it.

13
00:00:39,334 --> 00:00:40,429
Why?

14
00:00:52,306 --> 00:00:54,059
We've already dated for 5 years

15
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:55,251
I've slept with you countless times.

16
00:00:55,252 --> 00:00:57,932
and I'm more concerned about this lamp more than sleeping with you right now.

17
00:00:57,933 --> 00:01:00,634
Sleeping with you is not the same thing as loving you.

18
00:01:00,961 --> 00:01:02,502
It's just all physical.

19
00:01:03,109 --> 00:01:05,446
- Then let's get married
- What? What?

20
00:01:09,573 --> 00:01:11,040
My mother-in-law is wacky.

21
00:01:11,041 --> 00:01:13,466
I would have just let it go
if you were a stranger...

22
00:01:13,759 --> 00:01:16,732
But I couldn't just let it go since you're Ki Joon's little brother.

23
00:01:20,049 --> 00:01:22,647
I guess your Mother's blood does run in your veins.

24
00:01:23,209 --> 00:01:25,799
No, I just gave you the okay before I even asked her about it.

25
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:28,867
You keep taking her side and it's starting to get annoying.

26
00:01:35,151 --> 00:01:37,452
-Hae Yoon
-Why are you here?

27
00:01:48,070 --> 00:01:49,278
Are you crazy?!

28
00:01:53,470 --> 00:01:55,576
Wow... Today really stinks.

29
00:01:55,577 --> 00:01:58,937
Being cast suspicious over a man I don't feel anything for after getting dumped.

30
00:01:58,938 --> 00:02:00,991
Do you know how it feels to be broken up with?

31
00:02:17,910 --> 00:02:19,412
Dong Bi!

32
00:02:21,297 --> 00:02:22,975
Dong Bi!

33
00:02:28,863 --> 00:02:31,801
Is this where Ha Dong Gun lives?

34
00:02:33,697 --> 00:02:36,058
Yes he lives in that house

35
00:02:36,059 --> 00:02:40,508
They are amazing people.
And the Madame is an angel.

36
00:02:43,371 --> 00:02:47,102
[ Episode 2: 130 days before the wedding, meet the parents ]

37
00:02:55,636 --> 00:02:57,300
Is there something you're looking for?

38
00:02:57,301 --> 00:02:59,542
What do you have that's good for an older woman?

39
00:03:01,826 --> 00:03:06,558
This is soaked in honey. even those who can't eat red ginseng can eat this without worry.

40
00:03:06,559 --> 00:03:09,678
Is it okay for my fiancé's parent's?

41
00:03:09,902 --> 00:03:11,267
If you want that

42
00:03:14,910 --> 00:03:16,422
Buy this

43
00:03:16,423 --> 00:03:18,118
I think this would be good for that

44
00:03:18,119 --> 00:03:19,359
How much is it?

45
00:03:22,501 --> 00:03:24,502
[ A total of 320, 00 was charged to your card. ]

46
00:03:28,756 --> 00:03:30,032
Yes Hyung

47
00:03:30,033 --> 00:03:31,665
I told Min Ho to come over later.

48
00:03:31,666 --> 00:03:33,447
Since he's been married twice,

49
00:03:33,448 --> 00:03:36,517
he would know how to behave at the in-laws very well.

50
00:03:37,563 --> 00:03:39,743
You're right.
He's about to become useful.

51
00:03:39,744 --> 00:03:41,333
Where are you right now? Are you outside?

52
00:03:41,334 --> 00:03:43,307
Oh I was just at the mall buying a gift.

53
00:03:44,813 --> 00:03:48,014
But..
I'm spending way too much money.

54
00:03:48,015 --> 00:03:50,227
I'm scared of my credit card bill for this month.

55
00:03:53,266 --> 00:03:55,107
We don't need this, Mom.

56
00:03:55,108 --> 00:03:57,529
-You don't need it for japchae? - I'm making mushroom Japchae.

57
00:03:57,530 --> 00:03:59,947
Then you can just use it later.

58
00:03:59,948 --> 00:04:02,530
Spinach doesn't keep well. You need to buy it when you need it.

59
00:04:03,408 --> 00:04:05,558
The one who married you sure is lucky.

60
00:04:05,559 --> 00:04:08,008
You're good at homemaker, and gave him a son...

61
00:04:08,009 --> 00:04:11,225
and you don't even use anyone to help you
maintain that big house and you're young.

62
00:04:11,225 --> 00:04:12,591
You're not lacking in anything.

63
00:04:12,592 --> 00:04:14,497
I don't think he thinks that way.

64
00:04:14,498 --> 00:04:17,752
Women who live as well as you usually don't get treated as well.

65
00:04:17,753 --> 00:04:19,163
Men think that what you are doing is a given.

66
00:04:19,164 --> 00:04:21,315
You have to tell them off once in awhile for them to have some respect.

67
00:04:21,316 --> 00:04:24,791
-But since you're so good at everything...
-I'm doing it all for my own sake.

68
00:04:24,792 --> 00:04:26,506
What do you mean, it's for your sake?

69
00:04:26,507 --> 00:04:30,258
I'm training him so that he can't do a thing if I'm not around.

70
00:04:30,259 --> 00:04:32,132
So that even if he does have an affair,
he won't be able to leave me.

71
00:04:32,133 --> 00:04:35,328
-Is he having an affair?
-No, I keep a very close eye on him.

72
00:04:35,329 --> 00:04:36,787
I know everything that he's up to.

73
00:04:37,209 --> 00:04:38,515
But start putting aside a nest egg.

74
00:04:38,516 --> 00:04:41,080
One must prepare themselves for a good rainy day when things are going good.

75
00:04:41,081 --> 00:04:42,283
Mom, you really are something.

76
00:04:42,283 --> 00:04:44,647
Why don't you tell Hae Yoon to keep the option of divorce in mind when she gets married?

77
00:04:44,648 --> 00:04:47,300
- I think I should marry Hae Yoon off.
- Why the sudden change of mind.

78
00:04:47,300 --> 00:04:49,002
That family has a lot of money.
I've checked it all out.

79
00:04:49,002 --> 00:04:52,150
And I told Hae Yoon to find out his parent's social security number.

80
00:04:52,151 --> 00:04:55,373
- You really are...
- Let's go get some meat. Hanwoo

81
00:04:59,223 --> 00:05:01,540
No need for huge concern. She's just dehydrated.

82
00:05:01,541 --> 00:05:04,460
She can be discharged once the IV is done.
Call me and let me know if there's a change.

83
00:05:04,461 --> 00:05:05,980
Yes, Thank you.

84
00:05:10,785 --> 00:05:12,786
Do you like him that much?

85
00:05:15,268 --> 00:05:18,881
He hasn't called me once...
or even texted.

86
00:05:19,419 --> 00:05:23,177
- I think it's really over.
- How could he be like this?

87
00:05:23,178 --> 00:05:25,246
Even a dog shouldn't be treated like this.

88
00:05:25,247 --> 00:05:28,233
You've been dating for five years, how could he do this to you?

89
00:05:28,234 --> 00:05:29,762
You were always so good to him!

90
00:05:29,763 --> 00:05:32,670
You even put an ad for his restaurant in a magazine to advertise it..

91
00:05:32,671 --> 00:05:35,535
and you waited on him hand and foot when he was sick.

92
00:05:35,536 --> 00:05:36,682
Aunt..

93
00:05:37,611 --> 00:05:39,762
In any case, I think there's something wrong with me.

94
00:05:40,439 --> 00:05:45,729
Even after all this, I still don't hate him..
and I want him to tell me he wants me back.

95
00:05:46,334 --> 00:05:48,387
I'm not going to let that bastard get away with this.

96
00:05:49,785 --> 00:05:51,257
But what if I listen to you guys and things go downhill?

97
00:05:51,258 --> 00:05:54,027
Come on... I've been married twice.

98
00:05:54,028 --> 00:05:57,307
I'm successful at getting married... just not maintaining it.

99
00:05:57,307 --> 00:05:58,484
What are you curious about?

100
00:05:58,485 --> 00:06:01,194
Is getting a red ginseng sent appropriate for her mother? There is only her mother.

101
00:06:01,195 --> 00:06:02,595
That's a bit so-so.

102
00:06:02,596 --> 00:06:06,469
The first one is the France anti-aging cream

103
00:06:06,470 --> 00:06:08,556
She totally fell for it.
And for my second mother-in-law . . .

104
00:06:08,557 --> 00:06:11,373
Your explanation is always so long.
Forget it, I'll just take it to her.

105
00:06:11,374 --> 00:06:14,005
You are so critical.
You never let me finish what I'm saying.

106
00:06:14,006 --> 00:06:15,343
What would you like to order?

107
00:06:16,156 --> 00:06:18,979
I haven't seen you around. How old are you?

108
00:06:18,979 --> 00:06:21,569
What? I've been here for a month now.

109
00:06:21,570 --> 00:06:23,654
So what I'm saying is, how old are you? -I'm 25.

110
00:06:23,655 --> 00:06:25,726
Ah.. it's over for you after this year.

111
00:06:25,727 --> 00:06:27,741
Girls that are 25 are my favourite.

112
00:06:28,266 --> 00:06:30,763
Oppa, what would you like to order? - I have another dinner appointment.

113
00:06:30,764 --> 00:06:32,699
I don't have dinner plans.
What should I have?

114
00:06:32,700 --> 00:06:34,653
That's what Ajusshi should tell me.

115
00:06:37,821 --> 00:06:39,331
Why does she look so grumpy?

116
00:06:39,332 --> 00:06:40,526
You should fire her.

117
00:06:40,527 --> 00:06:41,846
She's so rude.

118
00:06:41,847 --> 00:06:43,050
She brings a lot of customers.

119
00:06:43,051 --> 00:06:44,776
Hyung, you're the one who shouldn't come.

120
00:06:45,230 --> 00:06:46,451
Don't fire her then.

121
00:06:47,441 --> 00:06:48,462
Keep your spirits up.

122
00:06:53,392 --> 00:06:55,049
Thanks Unni!

123
00:06:56,471 --> 00:06:57,845
Why didn't you arrive together with Sung Joon?

124
00:06:57,846 --> 00:07:00,294
We were going to meet at the restaurant, but I didn't want to see Ki Joon Oppa.

125
00:07:00,295 --> 00:07:01,824
So I just told him to call me when he gets here.

126
00:07:01,825 --> 00:07:03,996
Why are you being like that to Ki Joon because of Dong Bi?

127
00:07:03,997 --> 00:07:05,638
My friend's enemy is my enemy.

128
00:07:10,368 --> 00:07:11,466
Mm, it's tasty.

129
00:07:12,064 --> 00:07:13,985
But why hasn't our aunt come yet?

130
00:07:22,363 --> 00:07:23,462
I hate you.

131
00:07:23,462 --> 00:07:26,967
I don't know how to handle it when someone who's old enough to be my Dad acts up.

132
00:07:28,737 --> 00:07:30,639
Wow, she's got some attitude. She's cute.

133
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:32,705
What is her deal?
She's kind of cute.

134
00:07:32,706 --> 00:07:33,926
Even though I haven't learned anything, I need to get going.

135
00:07:33,927 --> 00:07:35,601
Tell her all the food is delicious

136
00:07:35,602 --> 00:07:37,797
And you better eat two servings of rice. - I know that too, hyung.

137
00:07:37,798 --> 00:07:39,385
You better get going, you're going to be late.

138
00:07:39,386 --> 00:07:40,570
Got it.

139
00:07:43,517 --> 00:07:44,896
Aunt!

140
00:07:47,070 --> 00:07:49,957
Noonim (respectful term for older sis), do you recognize me?

141
00:07:49,958 --> 00:07:51,430
Why don't you take a seat here?

142
00:07:51,431 --> 00:07:53,994
I was just about to go. Did you come knowing I was here?

143
00:07:55,437 --> 00:07:57,772
You know Ki Joong right?

144
00:07:57,773 --> 00:08:00,981
I know. I know about him well, Dong Bi has told me about him.

145
00:08:01,387 --> 00:08:02,931
Dong Bi and I have broken up.

146
00:08:02,932 --> 00:08:04,615
You broke up? When?

147
00:08:04,616 --> 00:08:06,195
Maybe a week ago?

148
00:08:06,196 --> 00:08:08,099
- You must be sad.
- Why sad?

149
00:08:08,100 --> 00:08:11,115
It's been five years, we grew tired of each other.

150
00:08:13,035 --> 00:08:14,721
- Aunt! - You got sick of her?

151
00:08:14,994 --> 00:08:16,888
You dated for five years and you got sick of her?

152
00:08:16,889 --> 00:08:18,900
Dong Bi, from breaking up with a guy like you

153
00:08:18,900 --> 00:08:21,883
she hasn''t even been able to drink water,
and had to be taken to the emergency room.

154
00:08:22,056 --> 00:08:24,037
But don't you think you're still overreacting?

155
00:08:24,038 --> 00:08:25,273
Yes, I'm overreacting.

156
00:08:26,744 --> 00:08:29,127
Even though I'm not blood related, I'm overreacting again.

157
00:08:29,128 --> 00:08:30,838
Dong Bi is someone who is precious to me.

158
00:08:30,839 --> 00:08:33,217
There's been many times I've helped her pick out gifts for you.

159
00:08:33,218 --> 00:08:36,192
and when she sued to worry about you,
I used to try to cheer her up.

160
00:08:36,193 --> 00:08:38,713
I should be allowed to have a say in your relationship.

161
00:08:38,714 --> 00:08:39,977
Aun't let's go outside.

162
00:08:39,978 --> 00:08:41,793
No matter how angry you are,
this is still a place of business.

163
00:08:41,794 --> 00:08:43,229
But she still says that she loves you.

164
00:08:43,230 --> 00:08:46,860
and doesn't hate you, only wanting you to contact her.

165
00:08:46,861 --> 00:08:48,792
This is what you call love.

166
00:08:48,793 --> 00:08:50,941
Something someone like you will never understand in his lifetime.

167
00:08:50,942 --> 00:08:52,189
Let go of me.

168
00:08:57,475 --> 00:09:00,954
I have to go to Dong Bi's place. I should make some congee for her to eat tomorrow.

169
00:09:00,955 --> 00:09:02,241
Go quickly to the house.

170
00:09:02,242 --> 00:09:05,049
-I'll take you to Dong Bi's.
- No, it's okay. Go now so you won't be late.

171
00:09:05,050 --> 00:09:09,388
-But still...
- Don't tell Hae Yoon... What I did.

172
00:09:10,038 --> 00:09:13,179
I just realized myself that I can be violent like this.

173
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,763
Are you afraid?

174
00:09:15,764 --> 00:09:18,169
I'm afraid Hae Yoon would be embrassed of me.

175
00:09:19,364 --> 00:09:20,856
Wait here just a moment, okay?

176
00:09:25,822 --> 00:09:28,726
Hyung, I think you'll have to escort Aunt to Dong Bi's place.

177
00:09:28,727 --> 00:09:31,122
I don't want to. What if she throws water in my face too?

178
00:09:31,123 --> 00:09:33,573
If she does..
It'll be good for you anyways.

179
00:09:33,574 --> 00:09:36,720
Hey, hey...how is that good?

180
00:09:36,721 --> 00:09:38,854
Okay, I got it.

181
00:09:40,811 --> 00:09:42,949
Aunt, Hyung Min Ho will escort you.

182
00:09:42,950 --> 00:09:44,679
That's okay. I can go by myself.

183
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:47,434
- It doesn't take long in a taxi.
-I have a bike too.

184
00:09:47,435 --> 00:09:49,710
That would make me feel better.

185
00:09:49,711 --> 00:09:52,168
I don't want to!
I don't even know this man!

186
00:09:52,169 --> 00:09:54,505
Sis.. Do you see me as a man?

187
00:09:54,907 --> 00:09:56,037
Don't do that..

188
00:09:56,038 --> 00:09:59,243
I've never dated an older woman before,
So I'm pretty inexperienced with that.

189
00:10:00,023 --> 00:10:02,924
Why don't you hang out with any normal men?

190
00:10:02,925 --> 00:10:05,799
Hyung is just joking, he usually is like this.

191
00:10:05,800 --> 00:10:08,295
- I wasn't joking, Sis.
- Why do you keep calling me that?

192
00:10:08,296 --> 00:10:12,132
How do you think it seems when an old guy calls you an older sister?

193
00:10:12,133 --> 00:10:15,502
Since you're old enough,
be more considerate of other's feelings.

194
00:10:16,513 --> 00:10:19,002
I can't ride my bike with someone who disrespect me like this either.

195
00:10:28,323 --> 00:10:31,897
- Hold on tight if you're scared.
- Can you go a little faster?

196
00:10:32,565 --> 00:10:34,954
Let's go!

197
00:10:44,424 --> 00:10:45,770
What is this?

198
00:10:45,771 --> 00:10:46,860
I'm going to give this to your mother.

199
00:10:46,861 --> 00:10:50,486
This is my company's new product. It means I will become her pet like this.

200
00:10:50,938 --> 00:10:53,697
I'm sorry for ruining the mood, but my mom doesn't like these sorts of things.

201
00:10:54,742 --> 00:10:56,662
Then what do I do?
This was part of my plan.

202
00:10:56,663 --> 00:10:57,703
Should I put it back in the car?

203
00:10:57,704 --> 00:10:59,826
No, even if she doesn't like it, you need to show her what you prepared.

204
00:10:59,827 --> 00:11:01,050
It shows her that you're making an effort.

205
00:11:01,704 --> 00:11:02,786
How do my clothes look?

206
00:11:03,750 --> 00:11:06,851
- Let's see.
- How is it? Do you like it?

207
00:11:08,168 --> 00:11:12,882
Honey, even if my mom acts in an offensive way, you must not be mad at me.

208
00:11:20,338 --> 00:11:22,495
It's so cute!

209
00:11:22,496 --> 00:11:25,773
You didn't need to bring me this from work!

210
00:11:28,216 --> 00:11:29,803
Thank you for liking it.

211
00:11:29,804 --> 00:11:31,812
I would like to formally introduce myself.

212
00:11:36,901 --> 00:11:38,430
It's good you came.

213
00:11:39,495 --> 00:11:40,637
Look at him.

214
00:11:41,255 --> 00:11:43,292
- You look handsome.
- You too, hyung.

215
00:11:43,293 --> 00:11:45,802
He isn't your hyung, he is going to become your uncle.

216
00:11:45,803 --> 00:11:48,621
Yes, he is going to marry your aunt.

217
00:11:49,349 --> 00:11:50,536
Thank you, mother.

218
00:11:50,537 --> 00:11:51,623
Mom.

219
00:11:51,624 --> 00:11:54,604
I welcome those who my daughter has chosen.

220
00:11:54,605 --> 00:11:56,200
I will take care of her all my life.

221
00:11:56,201 --> 00:11:57,662
Of course you must.

222
00:11:57,663 --> 00:12:00,550
- Talk in a casual way, mother.
- I will the next time I see you.

223
00:12:02,985 --> 00:12:05,814
I prepared food, but I don't know if it will fit to your liking.

224
00:12:05,815 --> 00:12:07,699
I will eat anything that you make.

225
00:12:08,249 --> 00:12:09,943
We need to prepare the table.

226
00:12:09,944 --> 00:12:11,806
I'll do it. Where is the table?

227
00:12:11,807 --> 00:12:14,460
Grandma, can't you give that toy to me?

228
00:12:15,695 --> 00:12:18,830
No I can't because it was given to me as a present by somebody special.

229
00:12:18,831 --> 00:12:20,782
You aren't supposed to give away gifts.

230
00:12:20,783 --> 00:12:22,684
I have something for Tae Won here!

231
00:12:22,685 --> 00:12:24,126
Wow!

232
00:13:06,748 --> 00:13:08,894
- As expected...
- What?

233
00:13:08,895 --> 00:13:13,666
Normally when young women take off their helmet and reveal their face, you fall in love with them.

234
00:13:13,667 --> 00:13:17,942
As expected, when the woman is too old, when she takes her helmet and reveals her face, there is nothing.

235
00:13:17,943 --> 00:13:19,352
I just figured it out today.

236
00:13:19,353 --> 00:13:21,060
Since I don't let an old woman ride on the bike.

237
00:13:22,998 --> 00:13:24,693
What a weirdo.

238
00:13:24,694 --> 00:13:26,056
- What's your name?
- What is it yo you?

239
00:13:26,057 --> 00:13:27,539
You told me not too call you noonim.

240
00:13:27,540 --> 00:13:30,394
Since we have no reason to meet again, there is no reason to call me again.

241
00:13:30,395 --> 00:13:31,734
So you don't need to know my name.

242
00:13:31,735 --> 00:13:33,960
Why don't we see each other again?
We'll see each other at the wedding!

243
00:13:35,326 --> 00:13:37,717
Seriously.. what are you upset about?

244
00:13:38,209 --> 00:13:39,645
Do you by any chance have feelings for me, noonim?

245
00:13:40,267 --> 00:13:41,275
It's Lee Deul Rae.

246
00:13:44,678 --> 00:13:45,861
Lee Deul Rae.

247
00:13:46,805 --> 00:13:50,050
Her first name is pretty, but when you put it together with her last name it's Lee Deul Rae.

248
00:13:50,051 --> 00:13:53,638
Lee Deul Rae...want to cause some trouble?
( word play on her name)

249
00:13:59,402 --> 00:14:00,768
Should I get you more soup?

250
00:14:01,894 --> 00:14:03,781
Yes, it tastes really good.

251
00:14:03,782 --> 00:14:05,633
She did everything.

252
00:14:05,634 --> 00:14:10,173
She does very well in housekeeping. It's because she takes after me.

253
00:14:10,174 --> 00:14:12,955
Before I get married, I need to learn from her.

254
00:14:12,956 --> 00:14:15,109
You'll be fine once you get to it, so don't worry too much.

255
00:14:15,110 --> 00:14:17,551
Also, in the beginning of a marriage, they always say it tastes good even if it doesn't.

256
00:14:17,552 --> 00:14:19,387
Does everyone do that?

257
00:14:19,388 --> 00:14:21,691
It's because your husband takes care of you.

258
00:14:21,692 --> 00:14:24,451
They say that as long as they love their wife, they'll accept just about anything.

259
00:14:25,366 --> 00:14:29,655
Do Hyun bought this for me,
and even though I don't like frivolous things.

260
00:14:29,656 --> 00:14:31,257
Even if I tell him he shouldn't, he keeps buying it for me.

261
00:14:32,395 --> 00:14:34,079
You should have told your husband to come as well.

262
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:35,397
We saw him occasionally, but

263
00:14:35,397 --> 00:14:37,069
it wasn't when the entire family was together.

264
00:14:37,070 --> 00:14:38,384
I think he had a night surgery.

265
00:14:38,385 --> 00:14:39,906
He couldn't refuse because they are V.I.P.

266
00:14:48,598 --> 00:14:49,797
Oppa.

267
00:14:55,457 --> 00:14:57,740
Don't leave too much for us and take it with you.

268
00:14:57,741 --> 00:14:59,840
Hye Yoon and Deul Rae don't eat much at home.

269
00:14:59,841 --> 00:15:01,338
You can eat it.

270
00:15:02,296 --> 00:15:05,383
Is your husband home? Why don't you try calling him?

271
00:15:05,384 --> 00:15:07,893
I did a moment before. If I call him again, he will get pissed.

272
00:15:08,364 --> 00:15:11,199
Why should he get pissed? It's a good thing for wife to be concerned.

273
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:14,155
I heard only dogs go out to greet a man once he's over the age of 40.

274
00:15:14,569 --> 00:15:16,912
Hye Yoon is very pretty. I envy her.

275
00:15:16,913 --> 00:15:20,179
Since the man is young, he has soft fine hair too.

276
00:15:20,179 --> 00:15:21,375
He does look cute.

277
00:15:21,376 --> 00:15:23,801
He seems like a young gentleman who hasn't gone through much hardships.

278
00:15:24,271 --> 00:15:26,176
I didn't even get to date like that,

279
00:15:26,177 --> 00:15:28,034
and got married after scurrying around being scared all the time.

280
00:15:28,663 --> 00:15:31,784
But the man is rich. That's enough.

281
00:15:31,784 --> 00:15:35,559
For him, his parents have all the money. It's hard to take the parent's wealth.

282
00:15:47,811 --> 00:15:50,840
- I think I need to go now.
- Don't go.

283
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:52,139
What would I do if I don't go?

284
00:15:52,140 --> 00:15:53,305
Let's sleep.

285
00:15:53,812 --> 00:15:56,981
You are crazy. Don't you know mom is waiting inside?

286
00:15:56,982 --> 00:15:58,478
I know.

287
00:15:58,479 --> 00:16:00,186
But I still don't want to be apart from you.

288
00:16:00,756 --> 00:16:02,227
Me too.

289
00:16:07,614 --> 00:16:09,115
Let's get married quickly.

290
00:16:15,253 --> 00:16:17,406
Did unni leave?

291
00:16:17,407 --> 00:16:19,604
- Thank you.
- About what?

292
00:16:19,605 --> 00:16:21,333
For warmly welcoming him.

293
00:16:22,152 --> 00:16:24,727
- You knew too, right?
- About what?

294
00:16:24,727 --> 00:16:26,376
You are so fox like.

295
00:16:26,377 --> 00:16:27,395
What?

296
00:16:27,749 --> 00:16:29,824
Their family is rich.

297
00:16:29,825 --> 00:16:32,757
It seems doctors gain a lot of money

298
00:16:32,992 --> 00:16:37,818
Land, house, building. They have an apartment in the center of Gangnam.

299
00:16:37,819 --> 00:16:40,338
They have a very good reputation as well. You hit the jackpot.

300
00:16:40,784 --> 00:16:42,033
Is that why?

301
00:16:42,510 --> 00:16:44,071
Then why would I?

302
00:16:44,072 --> 00:16:45,309
Because he is handsome?

303
00:16:45,310 --> 00:16:49,551
Being handsome is only good once when you walk down the aisle with him.

304
00:16:50,296 --> 00:16:52,041
You are a very scary person.

305
00:17:01,495 --> 00:17:03,117
Thank you, aunt.

306
00:17:03,479 --> 00:17:06,850
I don't know how much you are hurting because I haven't loved.

307
00:17:07,239 --> 00:17:12,542
How I acted when my mom died and how you are acting right now

308
00:17:12,543 --> 00:17:16,237
is the same so I'm thinking it's something similar.

309
00:17:16,238 --> 00:17:17,965
I just don't want to do anything.

310
00:17:17,966 --> 00:17:20,535
How could I become like this because of a man?

311
00:17:26,403 --> 00:17:29,060
- Don't go.
- I need to go.

312
00:17:29,095 --> 00:17:33,804
Just for a day, I wish we can be in the same place comfortably.

313
00:17:33,805 --> 00:17:36,076
That depends on how you make up your mind. I'm going.

314
00:17:50,286 --> 00:17:51,634
Who are you?

315
00:17:51,635 --> 00:17:53,310
Then who are you?

316
00:17:53,311 --> 00:17:54,802
I'm the owner of this seat.

317
00:17:54,803 --> 00:17:57,264
I'm the person covering for the owner of this desk.

318
00:17:58,097 --> 00:17:59,873
Dong Bi, it's been a long time.

319
00:17:59,874 --> 00:18:00,950
Why did you come out?

320
00:18:01,453 --> 00:18:04,828
I'm sorry for not calling you and being absent without notice.

321
00:18:04,829 --> 00:18:06,806
- And bailing out on you...
- Yeah, I like that.

322
00:18:06,807 --> 00:18:08,700
You know well what you did wrong.

323
00:18:08,701 --> 00:18:11,900
- I will make sure things like this doesn't happen again.
- Of course.

324
00:18:11,901 --> 00:18:13,930
No, nothing like that would happen again.

325
00:18:13,931 --> 00:18:15,786
Since I found somebody to replace you.

326
00:18:16,287 --> 00:18:18,707
- Pardon?
- I liked you for working well.

327
00:18:18,707 --> 00:18:20,521
and this is how you repay the favor?

328
00:18:52,152 --> 00:18:54,110
Aunt!

329
00:18:54,111 --> 00:18:56,903
You look better. Is there good news?

330
00:18:56,904 --> 00:18:59,792
- It's alright.
- Is my pizza ready?

331
00:18:59,793 --> 00:19:01,382
Just wait a little bit.

332
00:19:01,383 --> 00:19:02,518
Sit down.

333
00:19:06,854 --> 00:19:07,954
What?

334
00:19:07,954 --> 00:19:10,784
To be honest, I was curious about something so I made the excuse of wanting pizza to come.

335
00:19:10,785 --> 00:19:12,024
You are curious about me?

336
00:19:12,025 --> 00:19:14,309
What could you be curious about?

337
00:19:14,734 --> 00:19:17,251
- Do you like me?
- Don't talk rubbish!

338
00:19:17,252 --> 00:19:20,024
- It's about Hye Yoon's sister. Is it true?
- About what?

339
00:19:20,024 --> 00:19:23,179
I heard it from my sister. You would have told her.

340
00:19:24,261 --> 00:19:27,663
You might think it isn't important because it isn't about you.

341
00:19:27,664 --> 00:19:30,619
But I don't believe that a person can be that nonchalant.

342
00:19:30,620 --> 00:19:34,347
I believe that a person's family dynamics can affect the type of person you are.

343
00:19:34,348 --> 00:19:37,143
I don't know what you heard from my mom, aunt.

344
00:19:37,403 --> 00:19:40,888
But I observed Jung Hoon and Hye Yoon dating for a few years.

345
00:19:40,889 --> 00:19:42,907
When Jung Hoon is with Hye Yoon, he smiles a lot.

346
00:19:42,908 --> 00:19:45,950
It is not common to come across of woman who can make somebody smile.

347
00:19:47,043 --> 00:19:49,039
It wasn't even said through the person directly involved.

348
00:19:49,040 --> 00:19:52,158
If they found out that you are background checking through rumours

349
00:19:52,159 --> 00:19:53,599
they will just offend them.

350
00:19:53,600 --> 00:19:55,879
Oh my goodness! How is this background checking?

351
00:19:56,979 --> 00:19:59,291
- Here is your pizza.
- Thank you.

352
00:20:02,161 --> 00:20:05,251
What did you tell aunt for her to come chasing after me?

353
00:20:05,252 --> 00:20:07,638
I told you just so you only know.

354
00:20:07,639 --> 00:20:09,517
Why do you have a big mouth?

355
00:20:10,689 --> 00:20:13,276
So why do you have to hear from me that you have a big mouth?

356
00:20:14,502 --> 00:20:16,912
From now on, don't be involved in Jung Hoon's marriage.

357
00:20:16,913 --> 00:20:18,851
Don't make it difficult.

358
00:20:23,940 --> 00:20:25,818
Did you wait a long time?

359
00:20:25,819 --> 00:20:27,547
I got fired.

360
00:20:27,548 --> 00:20:29,580
She gave away my position to another person.

361
00:20:29,581 --> 00:20:31,109
How are you handling all this?

362
00:20:31,110 --> 00:20:33,190
It's a little sad, but it's not to the point that I want to die.

363
00:20:33,191 --> 00:20:35,880
- You don't want to die?
- I don't want to die because of work.

364
00:20:35,881 --> 00:20:37,724
Is work a big deal? I can just find another one.

365
00:20:37,725 --> 00:20:39,650
Love is a bigger problem because it can't be found.

366
00:20:39,651 --> 00:20:40,823
Come down.

367
00:20:40,823 --> 00:20:43,341
When the department store closes, I have to make my own clothes and wear them.

368
00:20:52,184 --> 00:20:53,774
It looks too much like a teacher.

369
00:20:53,775 --> 00:20:55,865
- You think so too?
- Change up your style.

370
00:20:55,866 --> 00:20:57,197
You're too rigid.

371
00:20:57,198 --> 00:20:59,423
Those are the words I hate the most.
Rigid and pragmatic.

372
00:21:04,251 --> 00:21:06,661
- What about this?
- I'll have to try it on.

373
00:21:09,098 --> 00:21:10,964
This is so expensive.

374
00:21:10,965 --> 00:21:13,497
- Be quiet. Somebody will hear.
- Why does it matter if they hear?

375
00:21:13,498 --> 00:21:14,639
It's the truth that it's expensive.

376
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:18,206
- Do you have to be so cheap?
-Are you going to charge it?

377
00:21:18,207 --> 00:21:20,000
I have a card with no interest for three months.

378
00:21:32,324 --> 00:21:34,333
I was wondering if you were going to make it
since you couldn't even drink a sip of water.

379
00:21:34,334 --> 00:21:35,497
You are alive now.

380
00:21:35,498 --> 00:21:36,657
So are you depressed?

381
00:21:36,658 --> 00:21:38,021
You guys are fighting over eating again.

382
00:21:38,022 --> 00:21:39,242
We aren't fighting.

383
00:21:39,243 --> 00:21:43,182
As a friend, I was just testing her fighting power for eating to see if she was back to normal.

384
00:21:43,183 --> 00:21:45,258
Alright, you should eat a lot.

385
00:21:48,786 --> 00:21:49,862
Dong Bi.

386
00:21:50,373 --> 00:21:52,754
There's no man that's good enough in this world for you to stop breathing.

387
00:21:52,755 --> 00:21:55,568
I know men well. So don't risk your life over a man.

388
00:21:55,569 --> 00:21:56,673
Then what about me?

389
00:21:57,203 --> 00:21:58,617
You have already risked your life.

390
00:21:58,618 --> 00:22:00,833
Don't think about anything else.

391
00:22:00,834 --> 00:22:02,027
Eat.

392
00:22:02,961 --> 00:22:05,080
Crazy people.

393
00:22:32,257 --> 00:22:33,859
Yes, it's the daycare center.

394
00:22:34,518 --> 00:22:36,402
Yes, I understand.

395
00:22:36,403 --> 00:22:38,513
You must come before 6:30.

396
00:22:38,514 --> 00:22:39,902
Yes.

397
00:22:44,841 --> 00:22:47,702
I keep seeing the bike in front of me.

398
00:22:48,734 --> 00:22:50,482
How much would the bike that the man with a square head

399
00:22:50,483 --> 00:22:54,591
and a stomach that protrudes and wears a colorful bandana rides cost?

400
00:23:06,445 --> 00:23:09,993
Take out a lot this time. It is really hard to manage.

401
00:23:10,884 --> 00:23:13,806
It's because you follow women in their twenties at your age.

402
00:23:13,807 --> 00:23:15,464
Then don't you meet women in their twenties?

403
00:23:15,465 --> 00:23:17,334
I am younger than you are.

404
00:23:17,335 --> 00:23:18,797
You are fifty the day after tomorrow.

405
00:23:18,798 --> 00:23:21,678
Age is nothing but a number. Isn't it a famous saying?

406
00:23:21,678 --> 00:23:23,986
Why is age nothing but a number? Do you know how honest your body is?

407
00:23:23,987 --> 00:23:25,747
You aren't cool!

408
00:23:26,858 --> 00:23:28,013
Don't get skimpy because you're doing this for free.

409
00:23:28,013 --> 00:23:29,292
Do it with care.

410
00:23:29,292 --> 00:23:31,106
You might just get yourself a new sister-in-law this year.

411
00:23:31,107 --> 00:23:32,666
You are going to marry again?

412
00:23:32,974 --> 00:23:34,678
I want to have children, Do Hyun.

413
00:23:34,679 --> 00:23:37,174
Even if I have a child right now, they will be still in elementary school when I become sixty.

414
00:23:37,878 --> 00:23:39,095
Don't laugh.

415
00:23:40,908 --> 00:23:42,797
Wait a just a moment.

416
00:23:54,712 --> 00:23:57,022
Director, you have a guest.

417
00:24:05,465 --> 00:24:07,667
I visited because I missed you.

418
00:24:08,466 --> 00:24:09,968
Are you mad?

419
00:24:12,788 --> 00:24:19,092
A person can be like that from time to time. What can I do when I want to see you like crazy?

420
00:24:21,866 --> 00:24:23,774
I can't?

421
00:24:24,704 --> 00:24:26,840
You can from time to time.

422
00:24:27,922 --> 00:24:29,774
You can't too occasionally.

423
00:26:09,223 --> 00:26:10,289
Hey!

424
00:26:11,713 --> 00:26:13,304
Lee Dong Bi

425
00:26:25,069 --> 00:26:26,442
Lee Dong Bi!

426
00:26:29,877 --> 00:26:30,984
Hey!

427
00:26:46,973 --> 00:26:48,429
Are you hurt?

428
00:26:50,538 --> 00:26:51,598
I'm alright.

429
00:26:56,350 --> 00:26:58,395
You said you would never come back.

430
00:26:58,396 --> 00:26:59,432
What's up?

431
00:26:59,433 --> 00:27:02,779
Does your heart beat? Do you even have a heart?

432
00:27:02,780 --> 00:27:05,750
How can you be so unaffected?
We dated for five years!

433
00:27:05,751 --> 00:27:08,345
Even if a dog in the neighborhood suddenly went missing, I would go searching for it out of curiosity.

434
00:27:08,346 --> 00:27:09,771
Am I nothing compared to a dog?

435
00:27:09,772 --> 00:27:12,303
Why are you making a fuss over trying to live like other people?

436
00:27:12,304 --> 00:27:15,189
When we first started, we said we would ignore marriage systems

437
00:27:15,189 --> 00:27:18,376
and relationships between a man and a woman and would find our own way.

438
00:27:18,376 --> 00:27:22,261
But I like you, and because I like you I want to go to you, what can I do about that?

439
00:27:23,284 --> 00:27:25,095
What can I do when I want to draw a border around you

440
00:27:25,095 --> 00:27:27,235
so nobody can see you or have you.

441
00:27:29,325 --> 00:27:31,335
Since I can't accept your demands

442
00:27:32,426 --> 00:27:34,258
I didn't hold on to you when you left.

443
00:27:44,421 --> 00:27:45,919
I understand.

444
00:27:46,468 --> 00:27:48,229
I understood you fully.

445
00:27:49,215 --> 00:27:50,347
I'll go.

446
00:27:53,370 --> 00:27:54,807
Where are you going?

447
00:27:56,655 --> 00:28:00,116
Do it properly! The angle isn't right!

448
00:28:12,769 --> 00:28:13,886
Do it like this.

449
00:28:29,682 --> 00:28:31,628
Okay, that's good.
That's pretty good.

450
00:28:31,629 --> 00:28:34,035
I do everything well when I am taught.

451
00:28:34,036 --> 00:28:36,403
-Do you want to drink?
- No.

452
00:28:36,403 --> 00:28:39,327
Because I'll get buzzed if I have a drink,
and if I get buzzed, I may want to have sex.

453
00:28:39,362 --> 00:28:41,392
You changed to much recently.

454
00:28:41,393 --> 00:28:42,424
I can't get used to it.

455
00:28:42,425 --> 00:28:44,134
How did expressing your feelings become so straightforward?

456
00:28:44,135 --> 00:28:47,128
Once I started letting it all out, I think my heart is getting lighter.

457
00:28:47,129 --> 00:28:49,875
To add on to that, since I got fired, I have nothing to lose.

458
00:28:49,876 --> 00:28:51,788
You got fire? You didn't leave?

459
00:28:51,789 --> 00:28:53,211
Yes, I got fired.

460
00:28:54,372 --> 00:28:58,184
I thought that reporter thing was going to work out for you
what are you going to do?

461
00:28:58,925 --> 00:29:00,318
I'm not going to fold these.

462
00:29:16,988 --> 00:29:20,261
I put herb oil because I thought you had a lot of surgeries and was tired.

463
00:29:20,262 --> 00:29:22,300
You feel feel less exhausted.

464
00:29:43,908 --> 00:29:45,379
Car center.

465
00:29:47,760 --> 00:29:49,945
Hello, this is Nam Do Hyun's cell phone.

466
00:29:55,531 --> 00:29:57,802
Hello, this is Nam Do Hyun's cell phone.

467
00:30:09,482 --> 00:30:10,888
Hey!

468
00:30:12,268 --> 00:30:13,811
You are going to work without eating?

469
00:30:13,812 --> 00:30:15,578
I'm late. I told Hye Yoon I would drive her to work.

470
00:30:15,579 --> 00:30:17,570
Is Hye Yoon sick? Is that why you are driving her to work?

471
00:30:17,571 --> 00:30:19,365
- I'm just doing it.
- Is she coming tomorrow?

472
00:30:19,366 --> 00:30:21,518
- Like last time...
- I told you that last time was my fault.

473
00:30:21,519 --> 00:30:24,210
- Why are you throwing a fit?
- I'll go now.

474
00:30:25,465 --> 00:30:27,279
You like her that much?

475
00:30:30,647 --> 00:30:32,401
What's wrong?

476
00:30:32,402 --> 00:30:34,029
I think I am a mother in law.

477
00:30:34,030 --> 00:30:37,249
I want to act like a mother in law because I think she is making him suffer.

478
00:30:37,967 --> 00:30:39,919
Don't come. I'm just going to take the taxi.

479
00:30:39,920 --> 00:30:42,908
I told you not to come. Even if you come right now, I'll be late.

480
00:30:42,909 --> 00:30:44,360
I'm late because you told me you would come.

481
00:30:44,948 --> 00:30:47,016
You just go off to work.

482
00:30:54,158 --> 00:30:56,276
- I'm hungry.
- Me too.

483
00:30:56,277 --> 00:31:00,143
In dramas, the woman would pack lunch and feed it to the man driving.

484
00:31:00,709 --> 00:31:05,900
Dramas are just dramas. Let's not compare.

485
00:31:05,901 --> 00:31:08,587
- Let's go to MT
- Where? What's MT?

486
00:31:08,588 --> 00:31:10,814
M.O.T.E.L... MT.

487
00:31:11,573 --> 00:31:13,814
I figured when you told me you would drive me to work.

488
00:31:13,815 --> 00:31:16,123
You are not the person to make a move without a goal.

489
00:31:16,581 --> 00:31:18,344
A person?

490
00:31:18,345 --> 00:31:19,564
Goal?

491
00:31:36,449 --> 00:31:38,167
Fine. Let's go to MT today.

492
00:31:38,168 --> 00:31:40,642
You think I'm some sort of a beast?
that you won't go?

493
00:31:40,642 --> 00:31:42,738
Why are you getting mad at somebody going to work in the morning?

494
00:31:42,739 --> 00:31:44,199
Would I be able to work when you are being like this?

495
00:31:44,199 --> 00:31:45,527
Are you the only one going to work. I am too.

496
00:31:45,528 --> 00:31:47,193
Do you really need to talk like that in the morning?

497
00:31:47,194 --> 00:31:51,011
What do you mean, someone? What a nice thing for a teacher to be teaching to her students.

498
00:31:51,012 --> 00:31:53,378
Okay. Fine, I'm sorry.
I shouldn't have said that.

499
00:31:53,379 --> 00:31:56,860
But you think you're being any better for asking like this over my slip of the tongue?

500
00:31:56,861 --> 00:31:58,018
It's because I am mad.

501
00:31:58,019 --> 00:31:59,925
Should you just say anything because you are mad?

502
00:31:59,926 --> 00:32:02,345
You can't take back words that have been spoken.

503
00:32:02,346 --> 00:32:05,059
Does it all end when you say it didn't mean anything when you have already hurt somebody's heart?

504
00:32:05,060 --> 00:32:08,205
Yes, when somebody else does it, it's an affair and when you do it, it's romance.

505
00:32:08,206 --> 00:32:10,512
- What?
- You were the first one to hurt me.

506
00:32:10,513 --> 00:32:12,720
I am a person who wouldn't make a move without a goal?

507
00:32:12,721 --> 00:32:14,322
How do you think about me normally?

508
00:32:14,323 --> 00:32:16,336
You couldn't have said that without thinking about me like that normally.

509
00:32:16,337 --> 00:32:20,225
Would I have decided to marry you if I normally think of you in that way?

510
00:32:23,231 --> 00:32:24,531
Why do you think we keep fighting?

511
00:32:24,532 --> 00:32:26,717
Why do you think we jump at such little things as if our life is on the line?

512
00:32:26,718 --> 00:32:28,568
I think I have problems.

513
00:32:28,569 --> 00:32:30,092
I'm sorry for ruining your morning.

514
00:32:30,093 --> 00:32:32,083
If you come out like this, I become a narrow minded fool.

515
00:32:32,084 --> 00:32:33,604
You are a narrow minded fool.

516
00:32:37,418 --> 00:32:39,488
- Teacher.
- Hello.

517
00:32:47,495 --> 00:32:49,532
Are the two of you perverts, huh?

518
00:32:49,533 --> 00:32:50,891
Yesterday you were loving each other to death

519
00:32:50,891 --> 00:32:52,541
today starting in the morning you're at each others' throats.

520
00:32:52,542 --> 00:32:55,106
I know that there's no other man like Jung Hoon out there.

521
00:32:55,106 --> 00:32:56,894
So I don't know why I'm so harsh with my words to him.

522
00:32:56,895 --> 00:33:00,108
That wasn't right how I treated him when he skipped breakfast to bring me to work.

523
00:33:00,545 --> 00:33:02,786
Do you think I need to rethink this marriage?

524
00:33:02,787 --> 00:33:05,995
Don't rethink the wedding,
and fix your personality.

525
00:33:05,996 --> 00:33:08,686
How long do you think Jung Hoon is going to let it go and just keep taking it?

526
00:33:08,687 --> 00:33:10,931
Your mother wasn't right to you either.

527
00:33:11,714 --> 00:33:13,315
How much is this?

528
00:33:25,154 --> 00:33:26,256
What's that?

529
00:33:46,660 --> 00:33:47,998
It's yummy.

530
00:33:47,999 --> 00:33:50,314
Why are you here again?
You cleaned up everything.

531
00:33:50,315 --> 00:33:52,181
You think I came because I wanted to?

532
00:33:54,141 --> 00:33:56,766
I can't live knowing that I owe someone a debt.

533
00:33:56,767 --> 00:33:59,202
Wow Dong Bi, you're different than others.

534
00:33:59,203 --> 00:34:02,108
Now even if I wanted to come back again, I'm out of excuses.

535
00:34:02,672 --> 00:34:05,042
-Should we be friends? -What do you mean about that?

536
00:34:05,043 --> 00:34:07,166
It means we need to update our relationship status.

537
00:34:07,667 --> 00:34:09,592
We can't go back to how we were before.

538
00:34:09,593 --> 00:34:12,718
When the word 'used' is said between a man and a woman, that means it's the end of it.

539
00:34:12,719 --> 00:34:14,587
Our relationship as lovers is over.

540
00:34:14,588 --> 00:34:16,436
and I won't do that tacky thing of trying to glue the broken pieces of that together.

541
00:34:17,563 --> 00:34:19,622
And what if I said I don't want to be friends?

542
00:34:19,623 --> 00:34:21,502
-Then that's the end.
- I've already seen this through the end.

543
00:34:21,503 --> 00:34:22,958
If you don't want to, forget it. I won't force you.

544
00:34:22,959 --> 00:34:24,015
I'll do it.

545
00:34:25,159 --> 00:34:26,613
Being friends - let's try it.

546
00:34:28,250 --> 00:34:30,066
Want some wine?

547
00:34:40,214 --> 00:34:42,708
I'm sorry for being a mad.

548
00:34:44,829 --> 00:34:46,875
Thank you don't say you're sorry

549
00:34:59,662 --> 00:35:01,377
I'm home!

550
00:35:01,378 --> 00:35:03,957
Why are you back so early?
Why aren't you out with Jung Hoon?

551
00:35:04,627 --> 00:35:06,872
I'm seeing him tomorrow.
I'm going to pay my respect to his parents.

552
00:35:07,496 --> 00:35:10,384
- Want to go on a blind date? - Mom!

553
00:35:10,384 --> 00:35:12,593
It's someone Ho Yong's mom knows

554
00:35:12,594 --> 00:35:14,229
And I heard that he is going to inherit a whole shopping mall.

555
00:35:14,230 --> 00:35:17,481
He's really intelligent, so they want a woman who's intelligent and witty.

556
00:35:17,482 --> 00:35:18,699
I heard they want a teacher for a daughter-in-law,

557
00:35:18,700 --> 00:35:21,514
Forget it, forget it. You already gave your permission, so what are you doing now?

558
00:35:21,515 --> 00:35:23,454
I'm going over to Jung Hoon's tomorrow, remember? You already forgot?

559
00:35:23,455 --> 00:35:25,167
I'm suggesting it because it's a waste.

560
00:35:25,168 --> 00:35:26,698
What do you mean, being wasted?

561
00:35:26,699 --> 00:35:28,409
Stop what you're doing, and just quit it altogether.

562
00:35:28,410 --> 00:35:29,539
I'm going to marry Jung Hoon.

563
00:35:31,100 --> 00:35:33,217
Oh right, mom!
- Why?

564
00:35:33,218 --> 00:35:35,299
The money that I gave you, how much did you saved?

565
00:35:35,300 --> 00:35:36,406
What money?

566
00:35:36,407 --> 00:35:37,632
What do you mean, what money?

567
00:35:37,633 --> 00:35:40,058
You've taken care of all my paychecks, and I've been getting allowances from it.

568
00:35:40,059 --> 00:35:41,690
Why are you asking for that money now?

569
00:35:41,691 --> 00:35:43,643
To get married I need money.

570
00:35:44,323 --> 00:35:47,625
Why would you need any money?
You just need to take care of the basics.

571
00:35:47,625 --> 00:35:49,937
And it''s not like you're going to be playing once you're married. You will be working.

572
00:35:49,938 --> 00:35:51,246
It's fine if you don't have money.

573
00:35:51,247 --> 00:35:53,601
Anyways, even if it's for the basics, give me my money now.

574
00:35:54,266 --> 00:35:55,689
I don't have any.

575
00:35:55,690 --> 00:35:57,978
My business isn't even doing well enough to cover the rent for my space.

576
00:35:57,979 --> 00:36:00,371
I used that money to pay rent, and for living expenses.

577
00:36:00,372 --> 00:36:01,725
You used my money for it?!

578
00:36:01,726 --> 00:36:03,363
That means it's gone!

579
00:36:03,364 --> 00:36:05,799
How can I get married without money?

580
00:36:05,800 --> 00:36:07,319
What about Aunt?
Why are you using my money first?

581
00:36:07,320 --> 00:36:10,062
Your Aunt is going to die old and alone without even getting married.

582
00:36:10,063 --> 00:36:12,937
so she should at least have some money.
How could I have touched her money?

583
00:36:13,493 --> 00:36:15,214
That's why I'm telling you to marry someone who has lots of money!

584
00:36:15,214 --> 00:36:17,404
There are plenty of men who'd love to marry a girl like you even if you had nothing.

585
00:36:17,405 --> 00:36:20,022
Where are those people?
Let me see them!

586
00:36:20,023 --> 00:36:23,344
Seriously. What is that matter with you?
Now I have nothing to offer!

587
00:36:23,345 --> 00:36:26,162
What do you mean, nothing to offer?
A man should take care of that himself.

588
00:36:26,163 --> 00:36:28,516
I have to take care of my own things why should I burden the man without everything?

589
00:36:28,516 --> 00:36:30,119
That's not a burden, but love!

590
00:36:30,120 --> 00:36:32,428
Your idea of love is leeching off of someone?

591
00:36:32,429 --> 00:36:33,909
Why you little Sass!

592
00:36:33,909 --> 00:36:35,534
There you go hitting again.
Since you don't have nothing to say to that!

593
00:36:35,534 --> 00:36:36,917
Why keep a business that can't even cover its own rent?

594
00:36:36,918 --> 00:36:38,039
Just get rid of it!

595
00:36:43,318 --> 00:36:44,501
Ah it's difficult.

596
00:37:12,209 --> 00:37:13,640
Hello?

597
00:37:13,640 --> 00:37:15,065
Is this the car center?

598
00:37:15,066 --> 00:37:16,078
What?

599
00:37:16,079 --> 00:37:17,765
It's not the car center?

600
00:37:18,361 --> 00:37:20,169
It's not.

601
00:37:20,170 --> 00:37:22,929
Sorry, I thought I was calling the car center.

602
00:37:23,439 --> 00:37:24,997
Wait a moment.

603
00:37:36,400 --> 00:37:38,627
- Hey Prissy.
- There you go provoking me again.

604
00:37:38,628 --> 00:37:41,056
- How are my clothes?
- Pretty.

605
00:37:41,091 --> 00:37:43,034
You think they'll like the gift?

606
00:37:55,361 --> 00:37:57,480
Mother, is there something I can help you with?

607
00:37:57,481 --> 00:37:59,942
- Mother is there anything I can do?
- Just go sit down, you're still a guest here.

608
00:37:59,943 --> 00:38:01,234
Mother, thank you.

609
00:38:01,235 --> 00:38:04,694
For treating me to delicious meals out and also for inviting me over to cook for me too.

610
00:38:04,695 --> 00:38:07,704
I'm scoring some brownie points so that you'll be good to us in the future.

611
00:38:07,705 --> 00:38:10,679
Give me some brownie points too so that Father will look kindly upon me too.

612
00:38:10,680 --> 00:38:14,616
He already liked you even before he met you,
Since you're the one Jung Hoon chose.

613
00:38:14,616 --> 00:38:16,825
Didn't you see the way he was looking at you during dinner earlier?

614
00:38:16,826 --> 00:38:19,536
I didn't see, Mother.
how was he looking at me?

615
00:38:19,537 --> 00:38:21,679
I'm not going to tell you. Find out for yourself.

616
00:38:21,680 --> 00:38:23,786
Mother, you're so loving.

617
00:38:24,225 --> 00:38:26,971
- Me?
- Yes, I'd like to be like you.

618
00:38:27,571 --> 00:38:29,105
The mood is good

619
00:38:29,106 --> 00:38:30,798
Let's put out the gift you brought too.

620
00:38:30,799 --> 00:38:33,675
I had no idea what to bring, so I worried about if for a long while.

621
00:38:33,676 --> 00:38:34,828
You did well.

622
00:38:34,828 --> 00:38:37,027
Anything too extravert would have felt like you were trying to bride us.

623
00:38:37,027 --> 00:38:38,068
So I would not have like it.

624
00:38:38,068 --> 00:38:39,835
This is nice and light.

625
00:38:44,705 --> 00:38:45,981
It's tasty.

626
00:38:45,982 --> 00:38:47,647
Thanks Mother.

627
00:38:53,500 --> 00:38:57,599
Honey.. she's here as a guest today,
so shouldn't you be doing this?

628
00:38:57,600 --> 00:39:00,436
See? How he looks after you over me already?

629
00:39:01,226 --> 00:39:05,346
But his warm gaze is being directed towards you, not me.

630
00:39:05,346 --> 00:39:09,012
Really? But I'm getting the glare from over there for ordering you around.

631
00:39:09,013 --> 00:39:10,391
That's not it, Mom.

632
00:39:11,941 --> 00:39:15,555
Getting another family member is really joyous thing.

633
00:39:15,556 --> 00:39:20,274
I'm really glad that the two of you have decided to marry.

634
00:39:21,337 --> 00:39:23,598
It's your time now.

635
00:39:23,599 --> 00:39:26,149
Once the two of you are married,

636
00:39:26,149 --> 00:39:28,975
your Mom and I are planning on moving down to the countryside to live.

637
00:39:28,976 --> 00:39:30,298
Dad!

638
00:39:30,299 --> 00:39:33,336
Build a small house down in the country, and run a hospital down there...

639
00:39:33,511 --> 00:39:35,411
Your Mom and I are going to live on our own down there.

640
00:39:35,412 --> 00:39:37,449
Your Father wants to spend some time with me now.

641
00:39:37,449 --> 00:39:39,773
Since he wasn't able to do that when we were young.

642
00:39:39,794 --> 00:39:43,156
Even though there are things that have worked out for us and things that have not...

643
00:39:43,157 --> 00:39:45,927
I have been blessed in many ways by this world.

644
00:39:45,928 --> 00:39:50,275
So I'd like to return some of the blessings I've been given back to the world.

645
00:39:50,698 --> 00:39:52,271
Do as you would like, Dad.

646
00:39:52,272 --> 00:39:55,196
We also started out very humbly, and it's gotten us where we are today.

647
00:39:55,197 --> 00:39:58,033
Starting off like that and watching things grow is rather fun.

648
00:40:06,705 --> 00:40:08,662
Mother and Father are so wonderful.

649
00:40:08,663 --> 00:40:11,153
Let's not be any more or less,
and live as well as they do.

650
00:40:49,782 --> 00:40:51,739
Nam Do Hyun Plastic Surgery?

651
00:40:53,116 --> 00:40:56,489
-What are you trying to say?
- Are you Nam Do Hyun's wife?

652
00:40:57,129 --> 00:40:58,174
That's right.

653
00:41:00,198 --> 00:41:01,444
Nice to meet you.

654
00:41:02,155 --> 00:41:03,815
I'm the car center.

655
00:41:05,096 --> 00:41:08,640
What would you like to order? Oppa likes the coffee here.

656
00:41:08,641 --> 00:41:10,399
He says he likes the Barista here.

657
00:41:14,815 --> 00:41:16,440
It's a new product.

658
00:41:23,215 --> 00:41:25,499
Doesn't it curl really well?

659
00:41:26,294 --> 00:41:28,718
It does curl pretty well,
but it doesn't seem to lenghten.

660
00:41:29,223 --> 00:41:30,685
Don't you have anything that lengthens?

661
00:41:30,686 --> 00:41:31,975
We do have it.

662
00:41:33,614 --> 00:41:36,866
- Here.
- How annoying... I have to apply it again.

663
00:41:36,866 --> 00:41:38,460
I'll come back next time.

664
00:41:39,295 --> 00:41:41,121
Please give me the cleansing set.

665
00:41:43,388 --> 00:41:47,753
- Stop by next time, okay?
-Ajumma, can't you give me another set?

666
00:41:48,341 --> 00:41:49,559
I'll come back next time.

667
00:41:50,656 --> 00:41:52,226
Make sure you come back again.

668
00:41:56,705 --> 00:41:58,554
What a jerk.

669
00:41:58,555 --> 00:42:00,818
Why did you give her everything she asked for?

670
00:42:01,170 --> 00:42:02,427
She's still a customer.

671
00:42:02,428 --> 00:42:04,795
I'm just grateful to anyone that stops in during bad economy like this.

672
00:42:04,796 --> 00:42:06,622
How did it go over at Jung Hoon's?

673
00:42:06,623 --> 00:42:09,516
There wasn't anything special since I already met his Mother a while ago.

674
00:42:09,517 --> 00:42:10,893
But his dad is impressive.

675
00:42:10,894 --> 00:42:11,928
How so?

676
00:42:11,929 --> 00:42:15,070
After we're married, he's going to donate all his wealth to people in need.

677
00:42:15,071 --> 00:42:16,248
And move down to the countryside.

678
00:42:16,249 --> 00:42:19,141
- What?! Then you guys?
- What about us ?

679
00:42:19,141 --> 00:42:20,620
What are they going to leave you?

680
00:42:20,621 --> 00:42:22,168
How would I know?

681
00:42:22,169 --> 00:42:24,143
What do you think is the reason for me allowing this wedding to happen?

682
00:42:24,144 --> 00:42:25,507
If you're not guaranteed the money, then this can't happen.

683
00:42:25,508 --> 00:42:26,609
Contact Jung Hoon!

684
00:42:26,609 --> 00:42:28,368
How can I ask him that before we're even married?

685
00:42:28,369 --> 00:42:30,512
Marriage boils down to money.

686
00:42:30,513 --> 00:42:34,833
You know very well yourself how hard I worked to raise you girls after your Dad died.

687
00:42:34,834 --> 00:42:36,633
- Still, that's a little...
-Then you just keep it still.

688
00:42:36,634 --> 00:42:38,162
-Then you stay still, Mom will go.
- No, I'll do it.

689
00:42:38,163 --> 00:42:40,314
Jung Hoon and I are the ones getting married here!

690
00:42:40,314 --> 00:42:41,923
It should be a decision made by the two of us.

691
00:42:41,924 --> 00:42:43,816
You think just anyone can make the choice and the decision?

692
00:42:43,817 --> 00:42:46,473
Is the man you chose financially independent?

693
00:42:46,474 --> 00:42:48,539
Ultimately, it's his parents that are going to foot the bill for the wedding.

694
00:42:48,540 --> 00:42:51,181
But the money they're supposed to give you is gone now,
so what wedding?

695
00:42:51,182 --> 00:42:52,767
We'll start off in a rental!

696
00:42:52,768 --> 00:42:54,943
Mother said that they started out very humbly too and got to where they are now.

697
00:42:54,944 --> 00:42:57,106
We can do that too! Is Jung Hoon a doctor?

698
00:42:57,107 --> 00:42:58,981
He will be making less money than you his whole life!

699
00:42:58,981 --> 00:43:00,909
Even so, he's still earning money!
That's all that matters!

700
00:43:02,331 --> 00:43:04,001
Who are you calling in the middle of our conversation ?

701
00:43:04,002 --> 00:43:05,023
I'm calling Jung Hoon!

702
00:43:05,023 --> 00:43:06,705
After hearing what you said, there's no way I can allow this marriage to happen.

703
00:43:06,705 --> 00:43:07,804
You stupid

704
00:43:07,805 --> 00:43:09,022
You can't.

705
00:43:10,724 --> 00:43:11,917
Hello?

706
00:43:13,765 --> 00:43:15,299
Hello?

707
00:43:18,705 --> 00:43:20,037
Hello?

708
00:43:20,038 --> 00:43:21,166
Who is it?

709
00:43:22,337 --> 00:43:23,825
They hung up.

710
00:43:24,881 --> 00:43:27,526
Deul Ja (Mom): Hand it over. Jung Min: Don't do it. I will mind my own matters.

711
00:43:28,049 --> 00:43:29,426
Okay.

712
00:43:30,985 --> 00:43:33,133
What are you going to do about dinner?
Want me to bring you something?

713
00:43:33,133 --> 00:43:35,629
Stop pretending to care about me like that and just take care of your own future.

714
00:43:35,630 --> 00:43:37,204
What's wrong with my future?

715
00:43:42,074 --> 00:43:44,175
You think I'm going to give up just because you're acting like that?

716
00:43:48,291 --> 00:43:49,662
Jung Hoon,

717
00:43:49,663 --> 00:43:52,498
It's Hae Yoon's mom,
my call got dropped earlier.

718
00:43:52,499 --> 00:43:54,034
Do you have any free time today?

719
00:43:55,238 --> 00:43:59,078
Do Hyun seems to prefer the dripped coffee over espresso.

720
00:43:59,079 --> 00:44:02,076
Is my husband the same Do Hyun that you keep talking about ?

721
00:44:02,077 --> 00:44:04,186
You must like checking things out.

722
00:44:04,187 --> 00:44:07,466
I came out to see what kind of a girl you are, but I think I can rest easy now.

723
00:44:07,467 --> 00:44:09,295
Break up with Do Hyun.

724
00:44:13,649 --> 00:44:16,636
We've been seeing each other for three years.

725
00:44:17,324 --> 00:44:20,556
If Do Hyun was just having fun,
he wouldn't have dated me for three years.

726
00:44:20,557 --> 00:44:22,269
You've never asked for anyone to break up before, have you ?

727
00:44:22,270 --> 00:44:25,032
You've never asked anyone to choose between you and a man's family before, right?

728
00:44:25,033 --> 00:44:26,940
If you had, you wouldn't have met up with me.

729
00:44:27,599 --> 00:44:30,236
There's been other women besides you.

730
00:44:30,237 --> 00:44:33,814
But it's the first time I've met anyone who actually had hopes like you do.

731
00:44:33,815 --> 00:44:37,945
I did some research. . .
but you used to be a nursing assistant too.

732
00:44:37,945 --> 00:44:40,409
It's not like you're any better than me when it comes to your background.

733
00:44:40,410 --> 00:44:42,452
and since you got to where you are by breaking up his previous family.

734
00:44:42,453 --> 00:44:44,021
you have no lef to stant on either, right?

735
00:44:44,022 --> 00:44:46,951
I've already calculated everything before I came out to meet you.

736
00:44:47,262 --> 00:44:50,698
I don't... play games that I can't win.

737
00:44:52,311 --> 00:44:54,191
I'm sure you've figured this in your calculation too, right?

738
00:44:54,192 --> 00:44:57,159
Breaking up a family and worming your way in isn't as easy as you think it is.

739
00:44:57,160 --> 00:45:00,038
I'm not going to be respectful to you anymore and just treat you however I see fit.

740
00:45:00,039 --> 00:45:01,797
This is how these things play out.

741
00:45:01,798 --> 00:45:04,955
I've put up with all that to be where I am.
I won't give up my spot easily.

742
00:45:04,956 --> 00:45:07,040
I already know that it won't be easy.

743
00:45:07,041 --> 00:45:08,536
But there's one thing that's different.

744
00:45:08,537 --> 00:45:10,138
I have a son.

745
00:45:10,139 --> 00:45:12,517
If you're going to win, you better come up with a new plan.

746
00:45:12,518 --> 00:45:15,584
There's a huge difference between having a kid or no kid.

747
00:45:15,585 --> 00:45:17,534
I know that you tricked him into marriage with a pregnancy.

748
00:45:17,535 --> 00:45:19,962
A kid ? I can have one too.

749
00:45:19,963 --> 00:45:21,861
I'm not on any birth control.

750
00:45:25,381 --> 00:45:27,641
I'll teach you one trick as to how you can win..

751
00:45:28,067 --> 00:45:30,003
Try to convince the man instead of stepping up yourself.

752
00:45:30,004 --> 00:45:32,381
The face that you're here itself means that you've already lost.

753
00:45:32,382 --> 00:45:34,269
You're overreacting because you've lost your confidence after meeting me.

754
00:45:34,270 --> 00:45:36,764
Because my youth and beauty is so blinding.

755
00:45:36,765 --> 00:45:39,537
It's something that you can never have yourself again.

756
00:45:40,679 --> 00:45:41,993
Crazy girl.

757
00:45:41,993 --> 00:45:45,258
Yes, how could I stell something that's not mine unless I'm crazy?

758
00:45:55,451 --> 00:45:57,372
I'm not going to hit you or insult you.

759
00:46:02,083 --> 00:46:03,492
Sorry.

760
00:46:04,175 --> 00:46:06,506
You may not know since you're still young...

761
00:46:06,507 --> 00:46:09,962
but you'll realize after some time passes, how foolish you were.

762
00:46:09,977 --> 00:46:14,419
When that time comes,
You're going to hurt yourself and insult yourself.

763
00:46:23,531 --> 00:46:25,064
Live with my husband.

764
00:46:25,911 --> 00:46:26,969
Once you start living with him,

765
00:46:26,969 --> 00:46:29,316
You'll realize there's nothing special to the man you stole.

766
00:46:29,317 --> 00:46:32,760
And also that the only thing you can trust,
is ultimately, yourself.

767
00:47:26,416 --> 00:47:27,513
Mother!

768
00:47:27,513 --> 00:47:30,915
I called you out even though I know you're busy because I couldn't leave the store.

769
00:47:30,916 --> 00:47:33,496
It's okay.
I'll come no matter what if you call me.

770
00:47:33,497 --> 00:47:35,776
Your words are so flattering.

771
00:47:35,777 --> 00:47:38,020
I heard our Hye Yoon went your house.

772
00:47:38,021 --> 00:47:39,146
Yes.

773
00:47:42,891 --> 00:47:44,140
Here, drink it.

774
00:47:49,638 --> 00:47:51,466
It's delicious, having come from you.

775
00:47:52,145 --> 00:47:54,882
I heard that your parents are really wonderful.

776
00:47:54,883 --> 00:47:55,977
Hae yoon told me herself.

777
00:47:57,509 --> 00:48:00,122
The reason why I wanted to see you is about meeting with your parents.

778
00:48:00,123 --> 00:48:01,236
When would be good for them ?

779
00:48:01,237 --> 00:48:04,358
They said they'll leave both next weekend and the weekend after that empty.

780
00:48:04,359 --> 00:48:05,430
When would be good for you?

781
00:48:05,920 --> 00:48:07,787
Hae Yoon told me...

782
00:48:07,788 --> 00:48:10,720
That your father has decided to do something really great?

783
00:48:11,807 --> 00:48:12,985
Ah.. giving back to the society?

784
00:48:12,986 --> 00:48:16,194
Yes, giving back to the society.
How is that going to work?

785
00:48:16,697 --> 00:48:17,791
How is it going to work?

786
00:48:17,792 --> 00:48:22,735
For example.. is he just giving away the hospital or the house?

787
00:48:22,736 --> 00:48:25,583
I don't really know myself.
Why do you ask ?

788
00:48:25,583 --> 00:48:30,006
I was just wondering if my daughter has the qualification for such a family like that.

789
00:48:30,006 --> 00:48:32,876
Mother, please don't say that!
Hae Yoon is over-qualified and then some!

790
00:48:32,877 --> 00:48:34,087
Mom, here's your food.

791
00:48:36,061 --> 00:48:37,253
Mom!

792
00:48:37,254 --> 00:48:39,206
Why did you call Jung Hoon?

793
00:48:39,207 --> 00:48:40,558
What do you mean?

794
00:48:40,559 --> 00:48:42,367
She wanted to talk about the meeting with my parents.

795
00:48:42,520 --> 00:48:44,254
- He's right.
- Let's go

796
00:48:44,255 --> 00:48:46,104
Mother's not done speaking yet.

797
00:48:46,105 --> 00:48:48,174
I'll relay the rest of her message, so just follow me out.

798
00:48:49,632 --> 00:48:50,839
Goodbye.

799
00:48:55,663 --> 00:48:58,769
How could you have addressed me like that?
That's no way to talk in front of Mother!

800
00:48:58,770 --> 00:49:00,435
Mother won't think very highly of me now!

801
00:49:00,436 --> 00:49:03,058
You should have told me that my Mom called you over!

802
00:49:03,059 --> 00:49:04,462
Look at how you're changing the subject.

803
00:49:04,463 --> 00:49:05,829
Then I have to speak up to you in front of her?

804
00:49:05,829 --> 00:49:06,949
That's silly!

805
00:49:06,950 --> 00:49:09,433
Even if you don't speak up to me,
you should have respected me.

806
00:49:09,434 --> 00:49:10,713
Is me seeing your Mother something for you to be upset about?

807
00:49:10,714 --> 00:49:12,983
The thing I'm upset about is that you didn't tell me about it first.

808
00:49:12,984 --> 00:49:15,037
What difference would it make if I told you about it first?

809
00:49:15,038 --> 00:49:17,591
I don't want you to see how low she can be.

810
00:49:18,153 --> 00:49:20,048
It's really difficult catering to all your moods.

811
00:49:20,049 --> 00:49:21,755
How are you catering to me.

812
00:49:21,756 --> 00:49:23,435
If it's too difficult, then let's quit!

813
00:49:23,436 --> 00:49:25,663
There you go with that again!
How can you say that so easily?

814
00:49:25,664 --> 00:49:27,034
I don't say it easily.

815
00:49:27,035 --> 00:49:28,773
We're about to get married...

816
00:49:28,774 --> 00:49:31,471
We have to discuss everything before we do anything!

817
00:49:31,472 --> 00:49:32,915
What are you saying we haven't discussed?

818
00:49:32,916 --> 00:49:33,906
How can you say that?

819
00:49:33,907 --> 00:49:35,480
There you go changing the subject again.

820
00:49:35,481 --> 00:49:36,859
You don't love me, do you?

821
00:49:36,860 --> 00:49:39,608
That's why you don't take me seriously, and keep dragging out the subject.

822
00:49:39,609 --> 00:49:41,746
If you truly loved me, you have to accept what I'm saying.

823
00:49:42,945 --> 00:49:45,134
Fine.. How can I beat you with words?

824
00:49:45,135 --> 00:49:47,255
I was wrong. Even if I wasn't, I am.
Are you satisfied now?

825
00:49:47,256 --> 00:49:48,682
You're not being sincere right now either.

826
00:49:48,683 --> 00:49:50,595
What does it mean you were wrong even if you really weren't?

827
00:49:50,596 --> 00:49:52,921
I'm being sincere. How can you believe that I'm being sincere?

828
00:49:53,575 --> 00:49:55,335
- Get down on your knees.
- Right here ?

829
00:49:57,734 --> 00:49:59,497
- We're in the middle of a street.
- You said you loved me.

830
00:49:59,498 --> 00:50:00,796
Then why can't you do it ?

831
00:50:05,035 --> 00:50:07,839
Forget it. I don't like my man getting down on his knees.

832
00:50:07,935 --> 00:50:09,053
You don't want me to do it now?

833
00:50:09,054 --> 00:50:10,738
Just the fact that you were willing to do it is enough.

834
00:50:12,315 --> 00:50:14,061
It really is difficult matching your moods.

835
00:50:14,467 --> 00:50:16,551
I'm hungry. Let's get some dinner.

836
00:50:16,552 --> 00:50:19,105
No, I have to get home.
Go eat with your mother.

837
00:50:21,906 --> 00:50:24,055
- There you go.
- Good luck selling.

838
00:50:24,056 --> 00:50:25,056
Yes.

839
00:50:28,429 --> 00:50:29,703
What did you say to Jung Hoon?

840
00:50:29,703 --> 00:50:31,082
Don't leave anything out and tell me everything.

841
00:50:31,083 --> 00:50:33,014
I didn't say anything to embarrass you, so don't worry.

842
00:50:33,015 --> 00:50:35,395
Mom, please! Just leave it to us!

843
00:50:35,396 --> 00:50:37,281
After seeing how he was today,
he was nice and compliant.

844
00:50:37,282 --> 00:50:40,945
After looking only at Do Hyun's face, I liked how he tried to please me.

845
00:50:40,946 --> 00:50:42,211
He's perfect for your personality.

846
00:50:42,212 --> 00:50:44,928
I told you, that I chose him after careful consideration.

847
00:50:44,929 --> 00:50:46,342
Let's meet his parents quickly.

848
00:50:46,343 --> 00:50:48,645
I doubt they'll leave him penniless when he's their one and only child.

849
00:50:48,646 --> 00:50:51,084
You seriously drive me crazy!

850
00:50:55,365 --> 00:50:56,804
What did Hae Yoon's mother say?

851
00:50:56,805 --> 00:50:57,934
Why did she want to see you?

852
00:50:57,934 --> 00:50:59,028
It was about meeting you guys.

853
00:50:59,029 --> 00:51:00,163
What about it?

854
00:51:00,164 --> 00:51:01,412
Hae Yoon said she'd let me know.

855
00:51:01,413 --> 00:51:03,149
If Hae Yoon was going to let you know, why did she ask to see you?

856
00:51:03,150 --> 00:51:04,285
It's because she likes me.

857
00:51:04,286 --> 00:51:06,645
I told you that she welcomed me with open arms when I went over to meet her.

858
00:51:06,646 --> 00:51:08,330
She was very nice and sweet.

859
00:51:08,331 --> 00:51:09,207
Give me some dinner.

860
00:51:09,208 --> 00:51:11,300
She sent you away without even feeding you if she's that sweet on you ?

861
00:51:11,301 --> 00:51:13,958
Mom, I'm going to get changed.
Want to see my muscles since it's been awhile?

862
00:51:13,959 --> 00:51:15,863
Fine, fine..
I'll set the table, so come on down.

863
00:51:34,106 --> 00:51:35,725
What is it that you're looking for?

864
00:51:36,110 --> 00:51:38,777
I'm not buying.
I just wanted to look around.

865
00:51:38,778 --> 00:51:40,161
- Are you going to ride it yourself?
- Yes

866
00:51:40,162 --> 00:51:43,779
This one has a lower seat so it's safer, and it's easy to control.

867
00:51:43,780 --> 00:51:45,913
So, this one is very popular with ladies.

868
00:51:46,509 --> 00:51:50,772
If you're looking for speed and thrill, something like this would be more fitting.

869
00:51:51,358 --> 00:51:53,679
- It's beautiful.
- What are you doing here?

870
00:51:53,680 --> 00:51:55,034
Are you going to buy a bike?

871
00:51:55,945 --> 00:51:57,834
Then, I'll be back.

872
00:52:01,682 --> 00:52:03,601
Deul Rae... Deul Rae!

873
00:52:04,107 --> 00:52:05,280
Deul Rae!

874
00:52:05,711 --> 00:52:07,825
Lee Deul Rae.. Deul Rae!

875
00:52:08,314 --> 00:52:09,958
What are you doing here?

876
00:52:11,494 --> 00:52:13,372
What is it that you're doing here then ?

877
00:52:13,373 --> 00:52:16,200
It's a given that I should come here.
this is the largest bike shop.

878
00:52:16,201 --> 00:52:18,845
Goodbye.
I have to get back to work now.

879
00:52:18,846 --> 00:52:20,435
Deul Rae, Lee Deul Rae...

880
00:52:20,436 --> 00:52:22,898
Why do you keep calling my name ?

881
00:52:24,540 --> 00:52:25,587
Do you want

882
00:52:25,920 --> 00:52:28,733
me to take you there on my bike?
I can take you to the Children's House.

883
00:52:30,321 --> 00:52:31,801
You like motorcycles, don't you ?

884
00:52:32,414 --> 00:52:34,533
You keep seeing them in your head, don't you?

885
00:52:48,131 --> 00:52:49,712
What are you saying right now?

886
00:52:49,713 --> 00:52:51,675
That's how I got started too.

887
00:52:57,673 --> 00:52:59,573
It's nice to be shopping with you like this.

888
00:52:59,574 --> 00:53:00,958
This is all your stuff.

889
00:53:00,959 --> 00:53:02,876
Why are you only buying things for yourself for the meeting with her Mom ?

890
00:53:02,876 --> 00:53:04,512
- Don't you even feel guilty ?
- What would you like ?

891
00:53:04,513 --> 00:53:06,021
Buy me a watch.
There's one I have my eye on.

892
00:53:06,022 --> 00:53:09,591
No, not a watch. You'll get wedding gifts from her family anyways.

893
00:53:09,592 --> 00:53:10,890
Tell Hae Yoo to buy it for you.

894
00:53:10,891 --> 00:53:13,049
How can I ask her to buy something that costs 500,000 won?

895
00:53:13,050 --> 00:53:14,789
I'm sure she's on that much sinces it's her wedding gift to you.

896
00:53:14,790 --> 00:53:16,411
And you're upsetting me a little.

897
00:53:16,412 --> 00:53:18,948
You don't feel bad about taking my money
but you don't want Hae Yoon spending hers?

898
00:53:18,949 --> 00:53:20,992
-It's not like that.
-I'm mad.

899
00:53:20,993 --> 00:53:22,382
You are a bad son.

900
00:53:26,935 --> 00:53:28,001
Welcome.

901
00:53:29,955 --> 00:53:32,776
-That's a little young for you.
It's a gift for Yae Hoon.

902
00:53:32,777 --> 00:53:33,738
She doesn't know anything about designer brands.

903
00:53:33,739 --> 00:53:35,725
She said people who buy designer things
is to make up for their lack of confidence.

904
00:53:35,725 --> 00:53:36,987
I've caught you again.

905
00:53:36,987 --> 00:53:39,574
Does that means that I buy designer things
because of my lack of confidence?

906
00:53:39,575 --> 00:53:42,208
No, it's no that.
She prefers practical things.

907
00:53:42,209 --> 00:53:44,927
That's because you don't know women.

908
00:53:44,928 --> 00:53:48,465
It's because Hae Yoon's family isn't wealthy enough to do anything about it

909
00:53:48,466 --> 00:53:51,259
But Yae Hoon is going to change once she becomes my daughter in law.

910
00:54:00,027 --> 00:54:01,673
I thought you were out shopping with you Mother?

911
00:54:01,674 --> 00:54:02,746
Then, why are you here?

912
00:54:02,747 --> 00:54:04,497
I think we should spent some part of the weekend together.

913
00:54:04,498 --> 00:54:06,041
I was about to get mad if you didn't come.

914
00:54:06,042 --> 00:54:07,401
I figured that's why I came.

915
00:54:07,402 --> 00:54:10,080
We didn't part in such good spirits last time after arguing.

916
00:54:10,081 --> 00:54:11,830
And we pass the date of the meeting through the phone also.

917
00:54:11,831 --> 00:54:13,729
-Did you hate me then?
- No, I hated myself.

918
00:54:13,730 --> 00:54:15,981
I felt pathetic for acting like that.

919
00:54:20,062 --> 00:54:21,205
I'm sorry.

920
00:54:23,848 --> 00:54:26,777
I'm going to go crazy.
I'm falling in love with you again

921
00:54:27,709 --> 00:54:29,290
Why is it that I can't hate you?

922
00:54:29,291 --> 00:54:32,545
It's your fate. Accept it.
Don't fight it.
